  <name>Kmux</name>
  <summary>Konsole-based terminal with project workspaces</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.vityas_off">
    <name>vityas-off</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>Kmux is a terminal emulator based on KDE Konsole with a project workspace model.</p>
    <p>Each project has its own independent set of terminal tabs, active tab, and split layout. Switching projects does not mix tabs from different projects.</p>
    <p>Kmux keeps Konsole's terminal emulation foundation, profiles, color schemes, shortcuts, split views, search, and KDE/Qt integration while adding workspace-level project tabs.</p>
  </description>
